The Riksdag adopts Chapter 5, Section 2 of the government's proposal for an act amending the Health and Medical Services Act (2017:30).&nbsp;
The Riksdag thereby approves Government Bill 2022/23:45, point 4, in this part, and rejects the motion 

2022/23:2329 by Fredrik Lundh Sammeli et al. (S) item 2.

